  "description": "In a world ravaged by war and a deadly plague, supernatural abilities are no longer just a fantasy. Sak, who was born with an extraordinary sense of smell, sets out to find his caller–the only person who can amplify his powers. When the two finally meet, Sak can’t help but feel an overwhelming affection. The catch? Sak’s love is one-sided, and his caller wants nothing to do with him. Now Sak must risk everything to bring his caller to safety–both their lives depend on it. \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Notes: Includes two extra chapters.*",
